# The SQLite index is DERIVED and rebuildable from the tracked JSON + provenance.
# Keeping it out of git preserves the "git is the bus" model and the single-writer rule.
# Rebuild with:  python graph/lib/rebuild.py
sqlite/graph.db
sqlite/graph.db-wal
sqlite/graph.db-shm

# Per-run scratch: immutable plans, executor state, shadow-eval working dirs.
# The durable record of a run lives in graph/provenance/*.jsonl (tracked).
runs/

# Python noise
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# WS 7b (2026-09-10): verdict_expiry.py's per-night state. The re-ask list is rewritten every night
# and means nothing tomorrow. The gold fingerprints degrade SAFELY when lost: every commodity reads as
# a baseline again, so nothing is re-asked on a gold change nobody saw.
sqlite/verdict-reask.json
sqlite/verdict-reask.json.tmp
sqlite/gold-fingerprints.json
